<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Reference-Specific Unlearning Metrics 
<br class="ltx_break">Can Hide the Truth: A Reality Check</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Sungjun Cho     Dasol Hwang     Frederic Sala     Sangheum Hwang
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
